00:08:16.912 --> 00:08:20.030
- [Evelyn] From check disbursement

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:20.883
I have,

00:08:22.360 --> 00:08:26.060
no Florida transportation in me.

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:31.060
I whizzed by there, and was
able to see New York again,

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:33.800
