your last whereabouts.

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:49.350
And people weren't able to follow me,

00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:52.290
as I picked up pennies and toots,

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:55.360
that together made a quarter for those

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:58.650
and a Mountain Dew drink made a dollar

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:02.080
as it has to be warm, cool, hot.

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:03.660
Then the marijuana will make you,

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:05.610
So I don't over smoke on them,

00:09:05.610 --> 00:09:07.868
that'll burn up green money.

00:09:07.868 --> 00:09:09.500
- [Interviewer] Do you
have any friends, Evelyn?

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:11.620
- [Evelyn] I have five friends.

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:14.920
My son is my body guard
now, as he grew stronger

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:19.920
through free eats or depositing
your nice verbal messages

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:23.710
like good morning, have a nice day.

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:26.030
See you later, alligator.

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:28.923
And that'll make steps or an elevator.

00:09:30.680 --> 00:09:35.680
And my sister, I think, went to Florida

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:38.810
and was able to photograph the alligators

00:09:38.810 --> 00:09:42.070
climbing out of the swamps.

00:09:42.070 --> 00:09:47.070
And that made the milkshakes
come up and I missed those.

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:52.220
So my face then enlarged, and
I was able to be photographed

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:55.550
with my screenplay and Donald Trump.

00:09:55.550 --> 00:09:56.900
Then my screenplay just turned

00:09:56.900 --> 00:10:00.000
into rolling paper and cigarettes.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:00.929
But at one time, it was a Sony jewel,

00:10:00.929 --> 00:10:05.900
making a marquee

00:10:05.900 --> 00:10:08.860
as I held it up for a taxi driver.

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:12.520
And he lists me off to the early Bronx

00:10:13.695 --> 00:10:17.180
or where the cab stops.

00:10:17.180 --> 00:10:20.303
Preferring chocolate is
payment in the early years.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:25.320
Now he accepts cash, but riding around,

00:10:25.320 --> 00:10:30.090
and that black interior will
sure make the ghetto spring up.

00:10:30.090 --> 00:10:34.567
And those boys are just
paid in milk and cereal.

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:40.633
- [Interviewer] All right, Evelyn.

00:10:40.633 --> 00:10:42.812
Well, thank you so much
for talking with me.

00:10:42.812 --> 00:10:44.060
- [Evelyn] Okay Albert.

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:45.260
- [Interviewer] And good luck with

00:10:45.260 --> 00:10:46.520
